<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><variables><variable id="dht-temperature">teplota</variable><variable id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</variable></variables><block type="program_start" id="dht-start" x="60" y="50"><comment pinned="false" h="125" w="400">Snímač DHT22 zapojte: VCC na 3,3 V, GND na GND a DATA na GPIO 9. Mezi DATA a 3,3 V připojte pull-up rezistor 4,7 až 10 kΩ. Pro DHT11 změňte typ snímače v bloku.</comment><next><block type="dht_init" id="dht-init"><field name="DHT_TYPE">DHT22</field><comment pinned="false" h="85" w="350">Inicializace připraví snímač na GPIO 9 a provede první kontrolní měření.</comment><value name="pin"><shadow type="math_number" id="dht-pin"><field name="NUM">9</field></shadow></value><next><block type="oled_init" id="X}hX,=`EuUjKElqKNKY@"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" display_type="AUTO"></mutation><field name="DISPLAY_TYPE">AUTO</field><comment pinned="false" h="57.20001220703125" w="320.79998779296875">Inicializace I2C OLED s řadičem SSD1306 na pinech SDA: GPIO21 a SCL: GPIO22</comment><data>@espide-display-target-used:5</data><value name="SDA_PIN"><shadow type="math_number" id="#B]%E0Bp#:n]d_A{|K+F"><field name="NUM">21</field></shadow></value><value name="SCL_PIN"><shadow type="math_number" id="ku#USzT=;]T?3jcHnPg)"><field name="NUM">22</field></shadow></value><next><block type="text_print" id="dht-ready-print"><comment pinned="false" h="75" w="340">Informace se zobrazí v REPL konzoli ve spodní části ESP IDE.</comment><value name="TEXT"><shadow type="text" id="dht-ready-text"><field name="TEXT">Teploměr a vlhkoměr je připravený.</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block><block type="program_loop" id="dht-loop" x="60" y="330"><comment pinned="false" h="90" w="360">V každém průchodu nejprve požádáme DHT o nové měření. Teprve potom přečteme teplotu a vlhkost.</comment><statement name="DO"><block type="dht_measure" id="dht-measure"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="350">Měření trvá přibližně jednu sekundu. DHT není určený pro velmi rychlé čtení.</comment><next><block type="variables_set" id="dht-save-temperature"><field name="VAR" id="dht-temperature">teplota</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="dht_read_temp" id="dht-temperature-value"></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="dht-save-humidity"><field name="VAR" id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="dht_read_humidity" id="dht-humidity-value"></block></value><next><block type="text_print" id="dht-print-values"><comment pinned="false" h="75" w="350">Spojíme text a obě naměřené hodnoty do jednoho přehledného řádku.</comment><value name="TEXT"><block type="text_join" id="dht-values-text"><mutation items="5"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><shadow type="text" id="dht-temperature-label"><field name="TEXT">Teplota: </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD1"><block type="variables_get" id="dht-temperature-print"><field name="VAR" id="dht-temperature">teplota</field></block></value><value name="ADD2"><shadow type="text" id="dht-middle-label"><field name="TEXT"> C       Vlhkost: </field></shadow></value><value name="ADD3"><block type="variables_get" id="dht-humidity-print"><field name="VAR" id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</field></block></value><value name="ADD4"><shadow type="text" id="dht-humidity-unit"><field name="TEXT"> %</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="espide_display_designer" id="SUgLQ+UV5X.%.NkA}hfX"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" display_designer_version="1" scene="{&quot;schema&quot;:&quot;espide.display-designer&quot;,&quot;version&quot;:1,&quot;width&quot;:128,&quot;height&quot;:64,&quot;mode&quot;:&quot;mono&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Obrazovka&quot;,&quot;layers&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;rect-1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;rect&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;width&quot;:128,&quot;height&quot;:15,&quot;radius&quot;:5,&quot;filled&quot;:false,&quot;color&quot;:1,&quot;bindings&quot;:{},&quot;visible&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;text-1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:1,&quot;width&quot;:118,&quot;height&quot;:14,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;DHT22 Thermometer&quot;,&quot;fontId&quot;:&quot;builtin-font-6x14-bold&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:1,&quot;parameterId&quot;:null,&quot;bindings&quot;:{},&quot;visible&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;text-2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Temp&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:32,&quot;y&quot;:14,&quot;width&quot;:67,&quot;height&quot;:32,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;22.5&quot;,&quot;fontId&quot;:&quot;builtin-ter-32-bold&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:1,&quot;parameterId&quot;:&quot;text-2-text&quot;,&quot;bindings&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:true},&quot;visible&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;text-3&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Hum&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:32,&quot;y&quot;:44,&quot;width&quot;:32,&quot;height&quot;:20,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;65%&quot;,&quot;fontId&quot;:&quot;builtin-ter-20-bold&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:1,&quot;parameterId&quot;:&quot;text-3-text&quot;,&quot;bindings&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:true},&quot;visible&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;bitmap-1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bitmap&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:16,&quot;width&quot;:27,&quot;height&quot;:47,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Snímek obrazovky 2026-08-26 223157.png&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;mono-hlsb&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:&quot;////B////wf///8H/+D/B3/A/wd/j/8HP5//Bz+f/wc/nwMHP58DBz+f/wc/n/8HP5//Bz+fgwc/n4MHP5//Bz+f/wc/n/8HP58DBz+fAwc/n/8HP5H/Bz+R/wc/kYMHP5GDBz+R/wc/kf8HP5H/Bz+RAwc/kQMHP5H/Bz+R/wcfEf8HjzH/B89w/gfv4P4Hb8D+BzeA/Ac3gPwHd8D8B2/A/gfv4P4Hjz//Bz8P/wd/wP8H//H/B////wc=&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:0,&quot;transparent&quot;:false,&quot;bindings&quot;:{},&quot;visible&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;drawing-1&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bitmap&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;width&quot;:128,&quot;height&quot;:64,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Drawing&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;mono-hlsb&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;transparent&quot;:true,&quot;bindings&quot;:{},&quot;visible&quot;:true,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;drawing&quot;,&quot;blackData&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;fonts&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;builtin-font-6x14-bold&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Font 6×14 Bold&quot;,&quot;fileName&quot;:&quot;font_6x14_bold.mfnt&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;builtin&quot;,&quot;catalogId&quot;:&quot;font-6x14-bold&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;builtin-ter-32-bold&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Terminus Bold&quot;,&quot;fileName&quot;:&quot;ter_32_bold.mfnt&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;builtin&quot;,&quot;catalogId&quot;:&quot;ter-32-bold&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;builtin-ter-20-bold&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Terminus Bold&quot;,&quot;fileName&quot;:&quot;ter_20_bold.mfnt&quot;,&quot;data&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;builtin&quot;,&quot;catalogId&quot;:&quot;ter-20-bold&quot;}],&quot;parameters&quot;:[],&quot;extensions&quot;:{&quot;espide.adaptive-display-v1&quot;:{&quot;version&quot;:1,&quot;width&quot;:128,&quot;height&quot;:64,&quot;profileId&quot;:&quot;espide-mono-128x64&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;128×64&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;workspace&quot;}},&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;profileId&quot;:&quot;espide-mono-128x64&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;128×64&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;workspace&quot;}}"></mutation><field name="PRECOMPUTE_STATIC">TRUE</field><field name="SHOW_DISPLAY">TRUE</field><field name="STORE_SCENE_FILE">FALSE</field><value name="DDYN_text_2_TEXT"><block type="variables_get" id="ffG$lz/@-.{Z)R;$1]dT"><field name="VAR" id="dht-temperature">teplota</field></block></value><value name="DDYN_text_3_TEXT"><block type="text_join" id="*5uNTmLXLk8E5V-4]J!J" inline="true"><mutation items="2"></mutation><value name="ADD0"><block type="variables_get" id="bym(6rsEUO416ClS9k_X"><field name="VAR" id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</field></block></value><value name="ADD1"><block type="text" id="7a?5Svz8p{(NXeK)oJkb"><field name="TEXT">%</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="dht-dry-air-if"><comment pinned="false" h="75" w="350">Při vlhkosti pod 30 % upozorníme, že je vzduch v místnosti suchý.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="dht-dry-compare"><field name="OP">LT</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="dht-dry-humidity"><field name="VAR" id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="dht-dry-limit"><field name="NUM">30</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="text_print" id="dht-dry-print"><value name="TEXT"><shadow type="text" id="dht-dry-text"><field name="TEXT">Vzduch je příliš suchý.</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="dht-wet-air-if"><comment pinned="false" h="75" w="350">Při vlhkosti nad 70 % může být vhodné místnost vyvětrat.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="dht-wet-compare"><field name="OP">GT</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="dht-wet-humidity"><field name="VAR" id="dht-humidity">vlhkost</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="dht-wet-limit"><field name="NUM">70</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="text_print" id="dht-wet-print"><value name="TEXT"><shadow type="text" id="dht-wet-text"><field name="TEXT">Vzduch je velmi vlhký.</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="utime.delay" id="dht-loop-wait"><field name="SCALE">sleep_ms</field><comment pinned="false" h="70" w="330">Před dalším měřením počkáme, senzory DHT11 a DHT22 mají periodu měření přibližně 1s.</comment><value name="TIME"><shadow type="math_number" id="dht-loop-time"><field name="NUM">250</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block>
